stdout:
reference[34]: Set expiry to now + D (positive Go duration). An unprotected lease renews only,while unexpired with a live owner on this machine; otherwise it refuses with,"exit 3 and reason expired, owner_dead, owner_unknown, wrong_machine, job_deadline,",or not_found. A --protect-live-owner lease with a live owner reattaches after,"expiry when its pinned resource is present (status: reattached); otherwise it",refuses with resource_absent or resource_unknown. All refusals exit 3; operation,failures exit 1.,"Examples:","  dibs extend <id> --ttl 2h","  dibs extend <id> --ttl 30m --json","",Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest,when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes a lease,"reclaimable: a live owner missing either cadence loses its resources.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Contract 1 (reconcile, reclaim, explain, extend, release, and --pending/--key):","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline. Extend success is renewed or reattached.","Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.",See docs/consumer-contract.md.,"","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs extend <id> --ttl D [--axi | --json]"
